        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection Bethpage Emergency Exit 5237 Lever with R027 Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid forged brass leverset has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage Lever features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure. Concealed mounting means that the sleek look is not interrupted by unsightly screws; and because it is made by Baldwin from solid brass, you know that it is made with attention to both style and quality. This leverset will fit doors from 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/4 inches thick, and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. An emergency exit knob, the lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior lever. Turning the interior lever will retract the latchbolt for immediate egress but will not unlock the exterior knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5237 Bethpage Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolt springs.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" 6 pin lock cylinder, pinned to 5</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Includes standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Bethpage Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bethpage Lever Length: 4.45\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" – 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Emergency Exit:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior knob. Turning the interior knob retracts the latchbolt for immediate egress. The door will remain locked from the exterior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Emergency Exit function is handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bethpage Keyed Lever, Baldwin 5237",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection Bethpage 5447V Lever with R027 Rose - This solid forged brass leverset has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage Lever features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure. It is available in a wide array of functions so you will be able to find just the right one to suit your needs. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches; and it is designed to conceal a 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled door.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5237V, baldwin 5447V, baldwin 5447V, baldwin FD Bethpage Levers, Baldwin PASS Bethpage Levers, baldwin PRVI Bethpage Levers, baldwin RDM Bethpage levers, baldwin LDM Bethpage levers, baldwin ENT Bethpage Levers, baldwin Bethpage Levers, Bethpage Lever with Bethpage roses, simple Levers, baldwin Bethpage door Levers, Bethpage leversets, forged brass door Levers, traditional door Levers, baldwin estates collections,"
